TI  -  Apixaban Is Effective and Safe in Reducing Venous Thromboembolism (VTE) in Obese Patients with Newly Diagnosed Pediatric Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia/Lymphoblastic Lymphoma (ALL/LL) a Sub-Study Analysis of the Prevapix-ALL/Children's Oncology Group ACCL1333 Trial
