ty of two oral regimens of dabigatran etexilate compared to a standard subcutaneous regimen of enoxaparin, in prevention of venous thromboembolism in patients with primary elective total knee replacement surgery. INCLUSION CRITERIA: 1. Patients scheduled to undergo a primary, unilateral elective total knee replacement 2. Male or female being 18 years or older 3. Patients weighing at least 40 kg 4. Written informed consent for study participation. Are the trial subjects under 18? no Number of subjects for this age range: F.1.2 Adults (18‐64 years) yes F.1.2.1 Number of subjects for this age range F.1.3 Elderly (>=65 years) yes F.1.3.1 Number of subjects for this age range
