TI  -  Anticoagulation after intracranial haemorrhage: results of surveys among stroke physicians
JA  -  European stroke journal
PY  -  2016
VL  -  1
IS  -  1
SP  -  82
C3  -  EMBASE 617000416
M3  -  Journal article; Conference proceeding
KW  -  *anticoagulation
