TI  -  Ultrasound-facilitated, catheter-directed thrombolysis vs anticoagulation alone for acute intermediate-high-risk pulmonary embolism: rationale and design of the HI-PEITHO study
JA  -  American heart journal
PY  -  2022
VL  -  251
CC  -  Vascular
